    summary60sEn: 'Under acute threat, tunnel vision saves your life. But in everyday life, chronic stress keeps you trapped in narrow, defensive problem-solving. Experiencing micro-moments of authentic positive emotion expands attention, allowing you to connect previously unrelated ideas and discover novel paths out of dilemmas.',
